From b1f8423e7d18629591f93f7a9b79e0c614f25dbf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Owen <root@your.mom>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:35:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Interleave local and relay chunks with bounded per-path
 credits

Base: streaming experiment on f8069b2. Advance ready relay chunks and local chunks in one progress loop, avoiding a complete local-payload queue ahead of transit traffic. Explicit window is negotiated across ranks and defaults off. Transfer order changes, reduction arithmetic and GPU completion flags do not. ASAN/UBSAN: 36000 collectives, delayed DMA, sequence wrap, partial readiness, independent directions, stop and geometry mismatch. Hardware qualification pending; not submitted upstream.
